To export all inventory items:

```ts
const data = exportInventoryItemsStep({
  select: ["id", "sku", "title"],
  batch_size: 100
})
```

To export inventory items stocked in a specific location:

```ts
const data = exportInventoryItemsStep({
  select: ["id", "sku", "title"],
  filter: {
    location_levels: {
      location_id: "sloc_123"
    }
  }
})
```
